<title>USA: Mesick Cons. Schools, Mich. won by Dain Bosworth. [Corrected 20:40 gmt]</title>
<headline>Mesick Cons. Schools, Mich. won by Dain Bosworth. [Corrected 20:40 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $7.105 million of Mesick Consolidated Schools, Mich., 1997 school building and site general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.4109 percent. (Corrects net interest cost from &quot;5.40&quot;)</p>
</text>
